msgid "# MS Service Metric"
msgstr "# MS服务指标"

msgid ""
"MS Service Metric collects vLLM Ascend runtime metrics through function "
"hooks and exposes them in Prometheus format. Install `ms_service_metric` "
"separately before using this integration; vLLM Ascend itself does not "
"require it to run inference."
msgstr ""
"MS服务指标通过函数钩子收集vLLM "
"Ascend运行时指标，并以Prometheus格式暴露。使用此集成前需单独安装`ms_service_metric`；vLLM "
"Ascend本身运行推理并不依赖它。"

msgid ""
"For installation, configuration syntax, and complete usage, see the [MS "
"Service Metric "
"documentation](https://gitcode.com/Ascend/msserviceprofiler/blob/master/ms_service_metric/README.md)."
msgstr ""
"有关安装、配置语法和完整用法，请参阅[MS服务指标文档](https://gitcode.com/Ascend/msserviceprofiler/blob/master/ms_service_metric/README.md)。"

msgid "## Basic Usage"
msgstr "## 基本用法"

msgid "Enable metric collection before starting the service:"
msgstr "在启动服务前启用指标收集："

msgid ""
"`PROMETHEUS_MULTIPROC_DIR` stores the Prometheus multiprocess metric files. "
"Use a separate directory for each service instance. Before restarting a "
"service for validation, remove stale files only after confirming that no "
"running service is using the directory."
msgstr ""
"`PROMETHEUS_MULTIPROC_DIR`存储Prometheus多进程指标文件。每个服务实例应使用独立的目录。在重启服务进行验证前，仅在确认没有运行中的服务使用该目录后，才可删除过期文件。"

msgid "After sending inference requests, query the vLLM metrics endpoint:"
msgstr "发送推理请求后，查询vLLM指标端点："

msgid ""
"The output can be scraped by Prometheus and visualized in Grafana. Use `ms-"
"service-metric off` to disable collection."
msgstr "输出可由Prometheus抓取并在Grafana中可视化。使用`ms-service-metric off`可禁用收集。"

msgid "## Custom Metric Configuration"
msgstr "## 自定义指标配置"

msgid ""
"Set `MS_SERVICE_METRIC_CONFIG_PATH` before starting vLLM. It can point to "
"either one YAML file or a directory containing multiple YAML files:"
msgstr ""
"在启动vLLM前设置`MS_SERVICE_METRIC_CONFIG_PATH`。它可以指向单个YAML文件或包含多个YAML文件的目录："

msgid ""
"Directory mode loads first-level `.yaml` and `.yml` files in filename order "
"and does not scan subdirectories recursively. The configured directory is "
"also the root for external Handler modules referenced by `module:function` "
"in these YAML files. Users are responsible for maintaining their custom YAML"
" files and Handler implementations."
msgstr ""
"目录模式按文件名顺序加载第一级`.yaml`和`.yml`文件，不递归扫描子目录。配置的目录也是这些YAML文件中`module:function`引用的外部Handler模块的根目录。用户负责维护其自定义YAML文件和Handler实现。"

msgid ""
"Run `ms-service-metric restart` after changing YAML configuration. Restart "
"the vLLM service after changing Handler Python code because imported Python "
"modules are not reloaded dynamically."
msgstr ""
"更改YAML配置后运行`ms-service-metric restart`。更改Handler "
"Python代码后需重启vLLM服务，因为导入的Python模块不会动态重新加载。"

msgid "## Adding a Metric Point"
msgstr "## 添加指标点"

msgid ""
"vLLM Ascend-owned metric configurations are stored as YAML files in "
"`vllm_ascend/observability/ms_metrics/config/`, one YAML file per feature. "
"All YAML files in this directory are loaded automatically."
msgstr ""
"vLLM "
"Ascend自有的指标配置以YAML文件形式存储在`vllm_ascend/observability/ms_metrics/config/`中，每个特性一个YAML文件。该目录下的所有YAML文件都会自动加载。"

msgid ""
"Keep configurations and handlers aligned with the vLLM Ascend "
"implementation. A missing symbol disables only the affected metric and must "
"not affect inference."
msgstr "保持配置和handler与vLLM Ascend实现一致。缺失的symbol只会禁用受影响的指标，不得影响推理。"

msgid "## Metric Level"
msgstr "## 指标级别"

msgid ""
"Ascend-owned handlers record a `MetricSpec` only when its `level` is less "
"than or equal to the active level. Hooks stay installed for the life of the "
"process. The next sample in that process uses the new level."
msgstr ""
"昇腾自有的处理器仅在其 `level` 小于或等于当前生效级别时才会记录 "
"`MetricSpec`。钩子在进程的整个生命周期内保持安装状态。该进程中的下一次采样将使用新的级别。"

msgid "| Value | Name | Recorded metrics |"
msgstr "| 值 | 名称 | 记录的指标 |"

msgid ""
"| `0` | `basic` | Default. Low-overhead, frequently consulted metrics |"
msgstr "| `0` | `basic` | 默认。低开销、频繁查询的指标 |"

msgid ""
"| `1` | `detail` | `basic`, plus specs declared at detail (per-step "
"durations and other more expensive metrics) |"
msgstr "| `1` | `detail` | `basic`，加上在 detail 级别声明的规格（每步耗时及其他开销更大的指标） |"

msgid ""
"**How to pick a level for a new metric** (read this before adding a point): "
"the level is decided by weighing the metric's collection overhead against "
"how often it is consulted. Metrics that are cheap to collect or commonly "
"watched on dashboards belong at `basic`. Metrics with per-step sampling, "
"high cardinality, or host-side computation cost belong at `detail`, so they "
"stay dark in the default deployment and are only turned on while debugging. "
"When in doubt, start at `detail`."
msgstr ""
"**如何为新指标选择级别**（在添加指标点之前请阅读本节）：级别的选择取决于指标采集开销与其被查询频率之间的权衡。采集开销低或通常在仪表盘上被关注的指标属于"
" `basic`。具有每步采样、高基数或主机侧计算开销的指标属于 `detail`，这样它们在默认部署中保持关闭，仅在调试时开启。如有疑问，请从 "
"`detail` 开始。"

msgid "Set it in `runtime_config.json`, the same file as `ascend_log`:"
msgstr "在 `runtime_config.json` 中设置，与 `ascend_log` 位于同一文件："

msgid ""
"`basic`, `detail`, and `0` through `1` are accepted. The stored value is the"
" name. With `runtime_config_hot_reload=true`, the next apply writes that "
"name into the process-local level: startup, the API / EngineCore file poll, "
"and the worker wave-head cascade. Each process keeps its own integer. An "
"invalid level rejects that load and leaves the previous level in place."
msgstr ""
"接受 `basic`、`detail` 以及 `0` 到 `1`。存储的值是名称。当 `runtime_config_hot_reload=true` "
"时，下一次应用会将该名称写入进程本地级别：启动时、API / EngineCore 文件轮询时，以及 worker "
"波头级联时。每个进程保留自己的整数。无效的级别会拒绝该次加载，并保留之前的级别。"

msgid "Change the level on a running server:"
msgstr "在运行中的服务器上更改级别："

msgid ""
"The API server sends a utility RPC to every EngineCore, the same path as "
"`POST /sleep`. Each EngineCore sets its own level (scheduler metrics run "
"there) and broadcasts `set_metrics_level` to its workers, including pipeline"
" stages that do not run the wave-head reload. The response is `{\"status\": "
"\"ok\", \"level\": \"detail\"}`. An unknown level returns HTTP 400."
msgstr ""
"API 服务器向每个 EngineCore 发送一个 utility RPC，路径与 `POST /sleep` 相同。每个 EngineCore "
"设置自己的级别（调度器指标在此运行），并向其 worker 广播 `set_metrics_level`，包括不执行波头重载的流水线阶段。响应为 "
"`{\"status\": \"ok\", \"level\": \"detail\"}`。未知级别返回 HTTP 400。"

msgid ""
"> **Do not mix the two channels.** The endpoint sets the level **in memory "
"only**; it does not write `metrics.level` back to `runtime_config.json`. The"
" file and the endpoint are separate channels — pick one per deployment. If "
"you use the endpoint and then edit `runtime_config.json` afterwards (even an"
" unrelated key), the file edit changes the digest, the next poll re-applies "
"the whole file, and `metrics.level` silently resets to the file's stale "
"value with no trace in the changes log. To make a level survive a restart or"
" a file edit, put it in `runtime_config.json` (or "
"`additional_config.runtime_config`) instead of calling the endpoint."
msgstr ""
"> **不要混用这两种通道。** 该端点**仅在内存中**设置级别；它不会将 `metrics.level` 写回 "
"`runtime_config.json`。文件与端点是相互独立的通道——每次部署请选择其中一种。如果你使用了端点，之后又编辑了 "
"`runtime_config.json`（即使是无关的键），文件编辑会改变摘要，下一次轮询会重新应用整个文件，`metrics.level` "
"会静默重置为文件中的旧值，且变更日志中不会留下任何痕迹。若要使级别在重启或文件编辑后仍然生效，请将其写入 `runtime_config.json`（或"
" `additional_config.runtime_config`），而不是调用端点。"

msgid ""
"This level applies to handlers that record through "
"`vllm_ascend.observability.ms_metrics.handlers.common`. Metrics emitted by "
"`ms_service_metric.provider_handlers` (scheduler, model-runner phase, "
"memory, and EPLB duration) follow the `ms-service-metric` on/off switch. "
"Lowering the level stops new samples. Series already created in the "
"Prometheus registry remain until the process exits."
msgstr ""
"此级别适用于通过 `vllm_ascend.observability.ms_metrics.handlers.common` 记录的处理器。由 "
"`ms_service_metric.provider_handlers` 发出的指标（调度器、模型运行器阶段、内存以及 EPLB 耗时）遵循 `ms-"
"service-metric` 的开关。降低级别会停止新的采样。已在 Prometheus 注册表中创建的序列会保留到进程退出。"

msgid "Declare `level` on a new expensive metric. The default is `basic`:"
msgstr "在新的高开销指标上声明 `level`。默认为 `basic`："

msgid ""
"1. Identify the target function and add its fully qualified `module:Class.method` name as `symbol`.\n"
"2. Reuse a stable handler from `ms_service_metric.provider_handlers` when it provides the required data processing.\n"
"3. For Ascend-specific processing, add a handler module `vllm_ascend/observability/ms_metrics/handlers/<feature>.py`, re-export the handler in `handlers/__init__.py`, and reference it as `vllm_ascend.observability.ms_metrics.handlers:function_name`. Reuse the shared helpers in `handlers/common.py` instead of re-implementing them: declare each metric as a `MetricSpec` (name, type, label names, and optional `level`) and pass the specs to `register_metrics`. Pick the `level` by the rule in [Metric Level](#metric-level) — overhead versus how often the metric is consulted. Record samples with `record_metric`, and skip expensive collection when `metric_enabled(spec)` is false. Wrap recording code in `safe_recording` for failure isolation. `common.py` is the only module that imports `ms_service_metric`, so feature handlers take `MetricType` and the helpers from there.\n"
"4. Since we are using a custom handler, metrics cannot be configured in the YAML file. Declare the metric in code as a `MetricSpec` (step 3) — a custom handler entry must contain only `symbol` and `handler`. Then update `tests/ut/observability/test_ms_metrics_provider.py`."
msgstr ""
"1. 确定目标函数，并将其完全限定的 `module:Class.method` 名称添加为 `symbol`。\n"
"2. 当 `ms_service_metric.provider_handlers` 中的稳定处理器提供所需的数据处理时，复用它。\n"
"3. 对于昇腾特有的处理，添加处理器模块 `vllm_ascend/observability/ms_metrics/handlers/<feature>.py`，在 `handlers/__init__.py` 中重新导出该处理器，并以 `vllm_ascend.observability.ms_metrics.handlers:function_name` 的形式引用它。复用 `handlers/common.py` 中的共享辅助函数，而不是重新实现它们：将每个指标声明为 `MetricSpec`（名称、类型、标签名以及可选的 `level`），并将这些规格传递给 `register_metrics`。按照 [指标级别](#metric-level) 中的规则选择 `level`——开销与指标被查询频率之间的权衡。使用 `record_metric` 记录样本，当 `metric_enabled(spec)` 为 false 时跳过开销大的采集。将记录代码包裹在 `safe_recording` 中以实现故障隔离。`common.py` 是唯一导入 `ms_service_metric` 的模块，因此功能处理器从那里获取 `MetricType` 和辅助函数。\n"
"4. 由于我们使用的是自定义处理器，指标无法在 YAML 文件中配置。在代码中将指标声明为 `MetricSpec`（步骤 3）——自定义处理器条目必须仅包含 `symbol` 和 `handler`。然后更新 `tests/ut/observability/test_ms_metrics_provider.py`。"

msgid ""
"A `metrics` block is only valid for entries that reference a provider built-"
"in handler (e.g. `ms_service_metric.provider_handlers:*`), which follows the"
" framework's factory convention. A custom handler with a `metrics` block is "
"treated as a factory, fails the factory call, and silently falls back to a "
"pass-through hook, so the metric is never recorded."
msgstr ""
"`metrics` 块仅对引用提供方内置处理器的条目有效（例如 "
"`ms_service_metric.provider_handlers:*`），这遵循框架的工厂约定。带有 `metrics` "
"块的自定义处理器会被视为工厂，工厂调用失败后会静默回退为直通钩子，因此该指标永远不会被记录。"

